  "description": "The Shift Plus i/O 5 is a super serious and powerful off road contender. Its built upon a Plus size 4 bar link frame with 140mm of travel on the rear and balanced with a Suntour Aion 140mm travel Boost fork on the front. Shift Plus i/O 5 is built with Shimano's revolutionary e8000 mtb specific mid motor drive system that delivers a whopping 250 watts of power, 70 Nm of torque, and 504 watt battery with a 4 hour recharge from flat. A Shimano 10 speed 1X set up keeps things simple. Kenda Havoc Pro 27.5\" x 2.8\" Plus size tires with U-40 double wall rims keeps things rolling, while a Shimano M395 hydraulic disc brake set brings it all to a complete stop. Shift Plus i/O 5 is one of the most versatile yet affordable eMountain bikes on the market today.",
